"默认波动阈值：偏离近期中位数至少20次/分且至少25%；至少5个新鲜样本；冷却3分钟。这是待校准规则，不是医学标准。" = "Default trigger: at least 20 bpm and 25% away from the recent median, at least 5 fresh samples, and a 3-minute cooldown. This is a tunable heuristic, not a medical standard.";
